<title>USA: Ameritech revises local phone resale rates.</title>
<headline>Ameritech revises local phone resale rates.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ameritech Corp said Wednesday it filed revised wholesale rates for the resale of local telephone service with the Indiana Utility Regulatory Commission.</p>
<p>Resale enables a competitor to buy local service from Ameritech at a wholesale discount and resell it to customers under its own brand name.</p>
<p>The discounts range from six to 18.5 percent, Ameritech said.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
